<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<Flow xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <apiVersion>65.0</apiVersion>
    <areMetricsLoggedToDataCloud>false</areMetricsLoggedToDataCloud>
    <assignments>
        <name>Assign_1</name>
        <label>Assign 1++</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <assignmentItems>
            <assignToReference>var_LatestContractNo</assignToReference>
            <operator>Add</operator>
            <value>
                <numberValue>1.0</numberValue>
            </value>
        </assignmentItems>
        <assignmentItems>
            <assignToReference>var_AddedContractNo</assignToReference>
            <operator>Assign</operator>
            <value>
                <elementReference>var_LatestContractNo</elementReference>
            </value>
        </assignmentItems>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Update_Settings_Latest_Contract_Number</targetReference>
        </connector>
    </assignments>
    <assignments>
        <name>Assign_LK_Ref_No</name>
        <label>Assign LK Ref No</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <assignmentItems>
            <assignToReference>var_LKRefNo</assignToReference>
            <operator>Assign</operator>
            <value>
                <elementReference>fm_LKRefNoNew</elementReference>
            </value>
        </assignmentItems>
    </assignments>
    <decisions>
        <description>신규 Biz 에서만 채번</description>
        <name>Check_Biz_Type_is_New</name>
        <label>Check Biz Type is New</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <defaultConnector>
            <targetReference>Assign_LK_Ref_No</targetReference>
        </defaultConnector>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>Default Outcome</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>is_New_Biz</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>fm_CheckNewBiz</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <stringValue>New</stringValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Get_Latest_Contact_No</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>is New Biz</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>LK Ref No. 에 사용할 계약번호(숫자5자리)를 갱신
(예) SF(LK Re, Faculty)-Sequence 5자리 - YYYYMM (Inception)

 

- S: LK Re_Singapore / K: LK Ins_Korea / V: LK Vietnam

- T: Treaty / F: Faculty

- Sequence: 계약별로 채번. 갱신 시, 동일 Sequence 사용

- YYYYMM: Inception Date 년월

 

참고로, 기존 LK Ref No 기준 채번 부여 후,  시스템 오픈 후 신규 생성되는 계약에 대해 이어서 번호 생성할수 있을까요?</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <description>원보험-IncomeClass</description>
        <name>fm_BizIncomeClass</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>TEXT ({!Get_Opportunity_Info.IncomeClass__c})</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <description>- S: LK Re_Singapore / K: LK Ins_Korea / V: LK Vietnam / A: LK A&amp;G</description>
        <name>fm_BizRegion</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>CASE( TEXT({!Get_Opportunity_Info.BizRegion__c}) ,
&quot;LK_KR&quot;, &quot;K&quot;,
&quot;LK_Re&quot;, &quot;S&quot;,
&quot;LK_VN&quot;, &quot;V&quot;,
&quot;LK_A&amp;G&quot;, &quot;A&quot;,
&quot;None&quot;
)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <description>신규 사업기회-채번된 5자리 숫자, 재계약 사업기회-기존 계약 Seq</description>
        <name>fm_BizSeqNo</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF ( {!fm_CheckNewBiz} = &apos;New&apos;, TEXT( {!var_AddedContractNo} ), 
   IF ( ISNUMBER( LEFT ({!Get_Opportunity_Info.RenewalInsurancePolicy_lk__r.LKRefNoh__c}, 1 ) ), RIGHT ( {!Get_Opportunity_Info.RenewalInsurancePolicy_lk__r.LKRefNoh__c}, 5),
MID({!Get_Opportunity_Info.RenewalInsurancePolicy_lk__r.LKRefNoh__c}, 4, 5) )
)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <description>재보험-TransactionType</description>
        <name>fm_BizTransactionType</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>TEXT ( {!Get_Opportunity_Info.TransactionType__c} )</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <description>- T: Treaty / F: Faculty / R: Retail</description>
        <name>fm_BizType</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF ( ISBLANK( TEXT({!Get_Opportunity_Info.CedingType1__c})), &apos;R&apos;,
      IF ( TEXT({!Get_Opportunity_Info.CedingType1__c}) = &apos;Treaty&apos;, &apos;T&apos;, &apos;F&apos; )
)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <description>신규 사업기회 인지 체크</description>
        <name>fm_CheckNewBiz</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF ( NOT ( ISBLANK ( {!fm_BizIncomeClass} ) ) &amp;&amp;  {!fm_BizIncomeClass} &lt;&gt; &apos;Renew&apos;, &apos;New&apos;,
    IF ( NOT ( ISBLANK ( {!fm_BizTransactionType} ) ) &amp;&amp;  {!fm_BizTransactionType} &lt;&gt; &apos;Renew&apos;, &apos;New&apos;, &apos;&apos; )
)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>fm_LKRefNo</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>{!var_Random4Char} &amp; &quot;_&quot; &amp; TEXT ({!var_AddedContractNo} )</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <description>출처 : 박찬주 수석님(26/3/25)
(예) SF(LK Re, Faculty)-Sequence 5자리 - YYYYMM (Inception)
- S: LK Re_Singapore / K: LK Ins_Korea / V: LK Vietnam / A: LK A&amp;G
- T: Treaty / F: Faculty / R: Retail
- Sequence: 계약별로 채번. 갱신 시, 동일 Sequence 사용, 신규 계약에서만 채번
- YYYYMM: Inception Date 년월</description>
        <name>fm_LKRefNoNew</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>{!fm_BizRegion} &amp; {!fm_BizType} &amp; &apos;-&apos; &amp; {!fm_BizSeqNo} &amp; &apos;-&apos; &amp; {!v_InceptionDateYear} &amp; {!v_IncpetionDataMonth}</expression>
    </formulas>
    <interviewLabel>LK_AUT_User_LatestContractNum_Update {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>LK_AUT_LatestContractNum_Update</label>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>BuilderType</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>CanvasMode</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>AUTO_LAYOUT_CANVAS</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>OriginBuilderType</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processType>AutoLaunchedFlow</processType>
    <recordLookups>
        <name>Get_Latest_Contact_No</name>
        <label>Get Latest Contact No</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>false</assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Assign_1</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <object>LatestContractNumMgmt__c</object>
        <outputAssignments>
            <assignToReference>var_LatestContractNo</assignToReference>
            <field>Latest_Number__c</field>
        </outputAssignments>
    </recordLookups>
    <recordLookups>
        <name>Get_Opportunity_Info</name>
        <label>Get Opportunity Info</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>false</assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Check_Biz_Type_is_New</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>Id</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <elementReference>v_BizRecordId</elementReference>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <getFirstRecordOnly>true</getFirstRecordOnly>
        <object>Opportunity</object>
        <storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically>
    </recordLookups>
    <recordUpdates>
        <name>Update_Settings_Latest_Contract_Number</name>
        <label>Update Settings Latest Contract Number</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Assign_LK_Ref_No</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Latest_Number__c</field>
            <value>
                <elementReference>var_AddedContractNo</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <object>LatestContractNumMgmt__c</object>
    </recordUpdates>
    <runInMode>SystemModeWithoutSharing</runInMode>
    <start>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Get_Opportunity_Info</targetReference>
        </connector>
    </start>
    <status>Active</status>
    <variables>
        <description>기회 레코드 Id</description>
        <name>v_BizRecordId</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <isCollection>false</isCollection>
        <isInput>true</isInput>
        <isOutput>false</isOutput>
    </variables>
    <variables>
        <name>v_InceptionDateYear</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <isCollection>false</isCollection>
        <isInput>true</isInput>
        <isOutput>false</isOutput>
    </variables>
    <variables>
        <name>v_IncpetionDataMonth</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <isCollection>false</isCollection>
        <isInput>true</isInput>
        <isOutput>false</isOutput>
    </variables>
    <variables>
        <name>var_AddedContractNo</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <isCollection>false</isCollection>
        <isInput>false</isInput>
        <isOutput>false</isOutput>
        <scale>0</scale>
    </variables>
    <variables>
        <name>var_CustomSettingLockCheckResult</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <isCollection>false</isCollection>
        <isInput>false</isInput>
        <isOutput>false</isOutput>
    </variables>
    <variables>
